1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,652
Reach your hands out,

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:06,913
cut through the wind,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,130
and forge ahead, drawing your own map as you go!

4
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:19,565
We can't even tell left from right

5
00:00:19,608 --> 00:00:22,782
in this tempest-tossed era

6
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,043
Even the values we've honed

7
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:29,390
seem ready to crumble

8
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:32,652
Is the compass leading us true,

9
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,869
or is it leading us astray?

10
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:39,217
Nobody knows for sure!

11
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:45,652
Just breathe deep, close your eyes

12
00:00:45,739 --> 00:00:52,696
and you'll find your soul guiding the way!

13
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,913
Reach your hands out,

14
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:59,174
cut through the wind,

15
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:04,043
and kick away the darkness!

16
00:01:05,086 --> 00:01:08,129
I'm doing this for myself,

17
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:12,260
and you're doing this for yourself too, right?

18
00:01:12,347 --> 00:01:17,347
Forge ahead, painting the world in your own colors!

19
00:01:33,608 --> 00:01:36,738
Explain yourself, Drake!

20
00:01:36,739 --> 00:01:39,609
This is my brand of justice!

21
00:01:41,347 --> 00:01:43,260
I envy you...

22
00:01:52,391 --> 00:01:53,695
Finger Pistol.

23
00:02:08,957 --> 00:02:10,739
Did you write your wish?

24
00:02:10,739 --> 00:02:13,391
Light up the sky lantern boats!

25
00:02:17,826 --> 00:02:19,695
Amazing! Amazing!

26
00:02:19,696 --> 00:02:22,043
It's so amaziiiing!

27
00:02:25,957 --> 00:02:28,913
Right, let's send them off!

28
00:02:28,913 --> 00:02:31,739
Send your wishes unto the skies!

29
00:02:32,782 --> 00:02:34,260
Daddy!

30
00:03:07,521 --> 00:03:10,260
Gum-Gum...

31
00:03:10,347 --> 00:03:12,260
...Hydra!

32
00:03:22,347 --> 00:03:25,173
He's bending the direction
of his attacks?!

33
00:03:27,826 --> 00:03:31,434
That's impossible!
Rubber doesn't work like that!

34
00:03:34,565 --> 00:03:36,173
Owwie!

35
00:03:40,521 --> 00:03:43,738
Stop it! That hurts!

36
00:03:44,391 --> 00:03:46,391
That hurts!
I'm beggin ya...

37
00:03:47,217 --> 00:03:49,608
...pwease stop!

38
00:03:53,739 --> 00:03:56,304
Yer still drunk?!

39
00:03:59,130 --> 00:04:04,130
Don't think you're the only one
that can see what's coming...

40
00:04:08,739 --> 00:04:11,304
How 'bout we play copycat...

41
00:04:21,739 --> 00:04:23,348
Like this?

42
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,957
Eeeyowowowow!

43
00:04:35,913 --> 00:04:37,869
He ate me!

44
00:04:37,869 --> 00:04:40,347
Lemme out, ya jackass!

45
00:04:44,739 --> 00:04:47,304
Open up!

46
00:04:54,652 --> 00:04:57,043
Blast Breath!

47
00:05:31,086 --> 00:05:32,521
Boundman!

48
00:05:36,869 --> 00:05:38,695
That son of a...!

49
00:05:43,608 --> 00:05:47,086
Man, I'm all beat up!

50
00:05:52,260 --> 00:05:54,434
Come back for more, huh?

51
00:05:54,435 --> 00:05:57,043
How much longer can I last?

52
00:05:57,086 --> 00:06:00,390
This is my last Gear 4!

53
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,783
I don't got any more
time to waste!

54
00:06:24,826 --> 00:06:28,260
Don't quit on me, Gear 4!

55
00:06:31,565 --> 00:06:32,260
Crap!

56
00:06:37,304 --> 00:06:38,825
I see now...

57
00:06:38,826 --> 00:06:41,130
That power of his is
surprisingly tough.

58
00:06:41,130 --> 00:06:43,521
The rubber power, that is.

59
00:06:43,565 --> 00:06:45,260
Shuddup!

60
00:06:47,043 --> 00:06:50,390
absolutely gotta
kick your ass outta here!

61
00:06:57,130 --> 00:06:58,956
Wano's people...

62
00:07:00,304 --> 00:07:02,782
...can hardly find water to drink!

63
00:07:04,696 --> 00:07:06,782
They can't eat 'til they're full!

64
00:07:09,130 --> 00:07:11,174
That's all while you're still around!

65
00:07:11,174 --> 00:07:14,913
That goes without saying!
They lost, after all.

66
00:07:15,565 --> 00:07:19,130
You oughta thank me
for not murderin' the bunch!

67
00:07:20,174 --> 00:07:24,521
I don't give a crap
whose side you're on...

68
00:07:26,565 --> 00:07:30,912
...but Wano's people are
experienced losers!

69
00:07:30,913 --> 00:07:33,391
The non-violent weak!

70
00:07:33,391 --> 00:07:35,261
Those who died with dignity!

71
00:07:36,521 --> 00:07:41,304
Even seen a bunch o' failures
make up excuses!

72
00:07:42,782 --> 00:07:44,782
Shuddup!

73
00:07:44,869 --> 00:07:47,565
The samurai are strong!

74
00:07:48,739 --> 00:07:52,739
Strong, you say?
Or just acting tough?

75
00:07:52,739 --> 00:07:57,435
Winners don't need
no flowery titles!

76
00:07:57,435 --> 00:07:59,391
Which one are you...

77
00:08:00,043 --> 00:08:01,825
Straw Hat?!

78
00:08:05,217 --> 00:08:07,869
Gum-Gum...

79
00:08:10,957 --> 00:08:14,087
...Over-Kong Gun!

80
00:08:41,608 --> 00:08:42,651
Not yet!

81
00:08:43,174 --> 00:08:45,434
I gotta make sure
he's down and out...

82
00:08:54,652 --> 00:08:58,043
...while I can still use Gear 4!

83
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,826
Thunder Bellow...

84
00:09:05,739 --> 00:09:07,913
...Bagua!

85
00:09:47,174 --> 00:09:49,391
No leaving allowed, strength!

86
00:10:06,347 --> 00:10:08,043
One more shot!

87
00:10:09,086 --> 00:10:11,564
Let's give this the perfect ending!

88
00:10:11,565 --> 00:10:13,999
If this don't work...

89
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,696
Show me what ya got, whelp!

90
00:10:16,739 --> 00:10:19,130
...then I lose!

91
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,957
Gum-Gum

92
00:10:48,304 --> 00:10:50,130
Over...

93
00:10:50,130 --> 00:10:52,826
Thunder Bellow...

94
00:10:54,304 --> 00:10:56,086
Iron Body!

95
00:10:56,086 --> 00:10:56,956
Wha?!

96
00:10:57,478 --> 00:11:01,608
CP-03!
Why are they here?!

97
00:13:22,435 --> 00:13:23,087
Eh?

98
00:13:26,435 --> 00:13:27,826
Luffy's voice...

99
00:13:29,130 --> 00:13:30,695
I can no longer hear it...?

100
00:13:49,217 --> 00:13:51,826
Battle of the Skull Dome Rooftop...

101
00:13:52,739 --> 00:13:53,652
The victor:

102
00:13:55,652 --> 00:13:57,609
Kaido the Beast King.

103
00:14:06,957 --> 00:14:08,913
You know what this means
for you, I presume...?

104
00:14:17,739 --> 00:14:20,869
You trash!

105
00:14:50,696 --> 00:14:51,608
Kawamatsu-san!

106
00:14:51,608 --> 00:14:53,651
The ceiling's about to collapse!

107
00:14:53,652 --> 00:14:54,696
You must evacuate!

108
00:14:57,652 --> 00:15:01,347
Thousands of our comrades
remain within the castle!

109
00:15:01,347 --> 00:15:03,782
And we will make it
home together, all of us!

110
00:15:03,782 --> 00:15:06,347
Alas, we are in midair!
There is no water to be had!

111
00:15:09,130 --> 00:15:11,652
There is naught we can do
to extinguish this blaze!

112
00:15:18,043 --> 00:15:20,782
You must all flee, I beg you!

113
00:15:20,782 --> 00:15:22,826
There is no honor
in burning to death!

114
00:15:35,086 --> 00:15:36,477
Blast Breath?!

115
00:15:37,565 --> 00:15:39,130
It... cannot be...!

116
00:15:48,391 --> 00:15:50,608
Kaido...!

117
00:15:53,782 --> 00:15:56,999
Where's that boss of yours?!

118
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,957
Bring me Oden's son!

119
00:15:58,957 --> 00:16:03,348
I wanna hear Momonosuke himself
announce surrender!

120
00:16:03,696 --> 00:16:06,739
Straw Hat Luffy's dead!

121
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,130
Huh?

122
00:16:11,347 --> 00:16:13,260
Luffy's dead?!

123
00:16:20,260 --> 00:16:22,043
Straw Hatter's voice...

124
00:16:22,391 --> 00:16:23,348
Vanished!

125
00:16:24,174 --> 00:16:26,782
So he was no match for
an Emperor of the Sea...

126
00:16:32,347 --> 00:16:35,477
What did you say...
about Luffy?

127
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:38,435
It can't be true...

128
00:16:39,130 --> 00:16:40,304
There's no way...

129
00:16:45,521 --> 00:16:48,347
...Luffy was killed!

130
00:16:50,521 --> 00:16:54,912
If anybody else still wants to
challenge me, step right up!

131
00:16:55,478 --> 00:16:58,565
I'm in the mood to
crack some more skulls.

132
00:17:00,347 --> 00:17:04,130
He did it!
Kaido-sama's claimed total victory!

133
00:17:08,217 --> 00:17:10,652
Big Bro Luffy...-

134
00:17:10,739 --> 00:17:13,391
Don'cha go dyin' on me...!

135
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:16,782
Hey!

136
00:17:16,782 --> 00:17:18,652
Don't even think about goin', nope!

137
00:17:18,652 --> 00:17:20,565
You want him to
keep mouthing off?!

138
00:17:23,347 --> 00:17:25,999
What the hell's that
overgrown snake on about, anyway?!

139
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:31,304
Keep those damn lies to yourself!

140
00:17:39,260 --> 00:17:41,086
Luffy's dead?

141
00:17:41,521 --> 00:17:44,738
Don't even think about telling me
some impossible lie!

142
00:17:45,652 --> 00:17:47,696
When Luffy says he's going to win....

143
00:17:48,826 --> 00:17:50,782
he'll win, no matter what!

144
00:17:53,043 --> 00:17:55,086
There's no way Luffy lost!

145
00:17:55,086 --> 00:17:58,608
Of course he's not dead!
That's ridiculous!

146
00:17:58,608 --> 00:17:59,825
Liar!

147
00:17:59,826 --> 00:18:04,434
Oh? Well, at least one of you's
got some moxie...

148
00:18:04,782 --> 00:18:05,608
I don't believe you!

149
00:18:05,608 --> 00:18:10,999
Since I'm such a nice guy,
I'll show ya what it means to be a loser!

150
00:18:12,782 --> 00:18:15,347
Blast Breath!

151
00:18:17,043 --> 00:18:18,260
Get back!

152
00:18:35,608 --> 00:18:36,782
O-Nami-chan!

153
00:18:38,260 --> 00:18:41,086
Don't lose your head!
Not 'til all's said and done!

154
00:18:45,174 --> 00:18:46,391
Luffy...

155
00:18:50,043 --> 00:18:55,434
Just as planned, Onigashima's gonna land
on the Flower Capital!

156
00:18:56,217 --> 00:18:59,130
I ain't some pushover like Orochi!

157
00:18:59,521 --> 00:19:01,651
He was too lenient.

158
00:19:02,304 --> 00:19:05,130
This country is one giant
weapons factory!

159
00:19:05,869 --> 00:19:10,086
Woman or child, I don't care who you are!
Everybody's a slave!

160
00:19:10,086 --> 00:19:13,564
Exhausted from working?
Drop dead, for all I care!

161
00:19:13,565 --> 00:19:15,999
That's all your lives
are worth, anyway!

162
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:19,304
Even if we lose slaves,
there's plenty more where that came from!

163
00:19:21,608 --> 00:19:25,521
You dared to fight back against me,
and earned my wrath!

164
00:19:26,652 --> 00:19:29,217
This is what it means to lose in war!

165
00:19:29,521 --> 00:19:35,173
And the price of your defeat:
your rights as humans, and your hope!

166
00:19:38,739 --> 00:19:43,261
Bring Momonosuke to me!
The fighting doesn't stop until I've dealt with him!

167
00:19:46,565 --> 00:19:50,217
Wano is finished, slaves!

168
00:19:50,217 --> 00:19:53,608
Your children, and your children's children
will drown in despair!

169
00:19:53,608 --> 00:19:56,391
Accept these terms of defeat!

170
00:19:56,391 --> 00:19:59,913
N-Not my wife and children!

171
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:03,565
Hey, now's our chance!

172
00:20:03,565 --> 00:20:05,651
Lop off Kid's and Law's heads!

173
00:20:06,086 --> 00:20:08,303
They're practically dead anyway!

174
00:20:11,478 --> 00:20:15,956
You might've beaten Big Mom,
our last line of defense is Kaido-san!

175
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:19,130
You guys never stood a chance!

176
00:20:21,260 --> 00:20:22,477
Damn nobodies...

177
00:20:26,565 --> 00:20:28,869
Protect the captains!

178
00:20:36,826 --> 00:20:39,086
Kaido?!
This ain't good!

179
00:20:39,086 --> 00:20:40,825
We gotta save everyone!

180
00:20:40,826 --> 00:20:42,217
Let's go!

181
00:20:42,217 --> 00:20:43,260
Okay!

182
00:20:43,869 --> 00:20:46,304
Mrrrrow!

183
00:20:50,304 --> 00:20:53,086
The inferno's on all sides!
We're done for!

184
00:20:53,086 --> 00:20:54,216
Is there no way out?!

185
00:20:54,217 --> 00:20:56,087
Look for an exit!

186
00:21:05,174 --> 00:21:07,739
I'm gonna fight, Trafalgar...

187
00:21:07,739 --> 00:21:10,913
No surrender...
Ain't gonna go down quietly!

188
00:21:14,260 --> 00:21:16,304
Dammit, Straw Hatter...!

189
00:21:22,086 --> 00:21:25,912
Pre... Preposterous!
Impossible, I say!

190
00:21:25,913 --> 00:21:29,130
What are we to do against someone
whom even Luffy could not defeat?!

191
00:21:29,130 --> 00:21:31,391
We keep going until
we've breathed our last!

192
00:21:31,391 --> 00:21:34,478
We must fight,
even if it means death!

193
00:21:34,478 --> 00:21:36,000
Is that not what a samurai is?!

194
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:40,435
Who but us can do it now?!
Everyone else is torn to shreds!

195
00:21:40,435 --> 00:21:43,043
Even Kaido must be
heavily wounded by now!

196
00:21:43,957 --> 00:21:45,739
Speak not such foolishness!

197
00:21:46,260 --> 00:21:47,956
After all, he is an Emperor of the Sea!

198
00:21:49,869 --> 00:21:53,478
We misjudged the depths
of his strength!

199
00:21:54,086 --> 00:21:57,651
We no longer have a chance!
We would only be adding more corpses to the pile!

200
00:21:58,174 --> 00:21:59,739
It is time to admit defeat!

201
00:22:00,565 --> 00:22:03,217
We did the best we could!

202
00:22:03,217 --> 00:22:06,608
Much as it galls me,
if Luffy has indeed lost,

203
00:22:07,652 --> 00:22:09,043
we must surrender!

204
00:22:11,739 --> 00:22:13,609
Absolutely not!
You will do no such thing!

205
00:22:14,217 --> 00:22:16,217
What meaning is there in survival...

206
00:22:16,217 --> 00:22:20,087
...if we return to slavery,
counting the days until we die?!

207
00:22:20,608 --> 00:22:23,825
Surrender does not mean salvation!

208
00:22:23,826 --> 00:22:26,391
You absolutely will not surrender!

209
00:22:27,696 --> 00:22:31,174
The regional Daimyo that
never yielded to Orochi...

210
00:22:31,174 --> 00:22:33,869
...died nobly, yet much to their chagrin.

211
00:22:35,565 --> 00:22:40,304
How the last twenty years of Wano are defined,
hinges upon this war we wage!

212
00:22:49,391 --> 00:22:50,652
Momonosuke-kun...

213
00:22:52,478 --> 00:22:54,435
If you would let it all go to waste...

214
00:22:56,652 --> 00:22:58,565
...then let us face death together!

215
00:23:37,347 --> 00:23:39,304
Momonosuke..

216
00:23:39,304 --> 00:23:40,304
Uh?

217
00:23:49,957 --> 00:23:51,565
Momonosuke!

218
00:23:52,347 --> 00:23:53,564
I hear them!

219
00:24:01,826 --> 00:24:04,086
How long has it been...!

220
00:24:06,086 --> 00:24:08,477
Zunesha, what is it you speak of?!

221
00:24:14,217 --> 00:24:17,695
I hear the Drums of Liberation!

222
00:24:19,043 --> 00:24:22,173
For the first time
in eight hundred years...

223
00:24:23,347 --> 00:24:26,651
He is here, I am certain!

224
00:24:29,217 --> 00:24:31,739
Wh... Who is?!

225
00:24:35,174 --> 00:24:37,521
Joyboy...

226
00:24:37,521 --> 00:24:39,434
...has returned!